Dawson, C.W. (2015) Projects in Computing and Information Systems: A Student’s Guide. 3rd edn. Harlow: Pearson.

Hoong, Y., Rezania, D. and Baker, R. (2024) ‘When traditional SME managers encounter cybersecurity: Discourse analysis of opportunities and dilemmas in meeting the demands’, Technology in Society, 78, 102650.

IASME Consortium (2023) Cyber Essentials self-assessment / verified assessment guidance. Available at: IASME official site.

National Cyber Security Centre (2023) Cyber Essentials: Requirements for IT Infrastructure v3.1. London: NCSC.

Rawindaran, N. et al. (2023) ‘Perspective of small and medium enterprise (SME’s) and their relationship with cybersecurity’, Computers and Society / related indexed source. Available via ScienceDirect abstract.

UK Government / DSIT (2024) Cyber Essentials scheme impact evaluation. Available at: GOV.UK.

Von Solms, R. and Van Niekerk, J. (2013) ‘From information security to cyber security’, Computers & Security, 38, pp. 97–102.

